# Exceptions for the dependency gates (scripts/dep-gate.sh), one per line:
#   <name>@<version> <CHECK> <justification>
# CHECK is one of the gate's check names:
#   JavaScript: AGE SCRIPTS SIGNATURE PROVENANCE VULNS HIPCHECK REGISTRY
#   Go:         AGE SUMDB VULNS HIPCHECK PROXY
# An entry turns a FAIL on that exact name@version and check into ACCEPTED and
# prints the justification. Exceptions are exact-version and per-check, so a
# transitive dependency needs its own line. Record who decided and why; this
# file is reviewed in pull requests, and it is how a reviewed "Investigate"
# verdict is recorded without loosening the Hipcheck policy.
